---
/**
 * The animals, trees and the safari car drawn once and reused (<use href="#wild-giraffe" />) by the horizon,
 * the migration band and the road under the header. Hidden from screen readers: they are scenery.
 * Everything faces right, stands on y = its viewBox height, and fills with currentColor.
 */
---

<svg class="wild-symbols" width="0" height="0" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
  <!-- Umbrella thorn acacia: a flat, layered crown on a forked trunk -->
